  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven : 13 + 4 × 2 ÷ 5 − 2 = ?\n\nAfter '+' and ‘-' are interchanged and '×' and ‘÷' are interchanged then,\n\n13 + 4 × 2 ÷ 5 − 2 = ? ⇒ 13 - 4 ÷ 2 × 5 + 2 = ?\n\n⇒ 13 - __**4 **____**÷**____** 2**__ × 5 + 2 = ?\n\n⇒ 13 - __**2**____** ×**____** 5**__ + 2 = ?\n\n⇒ __**13 + 2**__ - 10 = ?\n\n⇒ __**15 - 10**__ = ?\n\n⇒ 5 = ?\n\nHence, \"Option 4\" is the correct answer.",
